    "detailed_description": "My Friend Aki is a <strong>puzzle-based exploration game</strong> focusing on the use of <strong>improvised tools</strong> to make your way through the hallways of an abandoned mall. <i>What remnants were left behind by the building's previous curators? What bright and <strong>glowing secrets</strong> now lie nestled away?</i> Make use of the game's novel <strong>dynamic lighting system</strong> to illuminate gloomy corners and dusty hallways as you slowly turn parts of the mall back on. Make your way forward by creatively utilizing what was left behind.",
